# Assignment New

This project is a simple static website created in the local folder `D:\gitprojects\assignment-new`.

## Project overview
- Project type: Static HTML page
- Main file: `index.html`
- Purpose: A basic webpage assignment or demo project

## How to view it locally
1. Open the project folder in VS Code.
2. Open `index.html` in your browser.
3. You can also use a browser preview or live preview extension.

## Files included
- `index.html` — the main page content
- `README` — project documentation

## Publish to GitHub
Run the following commands in PowerShell:

```powershell
cd "D:\gitprojects\assignment-new"
git init
git add .
git commit -m "Initial commit"
git branch -M main
git remote add origin https://github.com/sugandh001/assignment-new.git
git push -u origin main
```

## Notes
This project is currently stored locally and can be pushed to GitHub once the remote repository is created and connected.
    